  "description": "Pure-managed reader for Microsoft Access JET databases (.mdb/.accdb). No OleDB, ODBC, or ACE drivers required. Typed DataTables and object[] streaming by default, verified cell-by-cell against the Access engine.",
  "id": "JetDatabaseReader",
  "isPrerelease": false,
